    "searchText": "orison relief orison relief: large fabrication order ors_cr_large unknown provider priority standing priority +2 pickup: stanton alright,\n\nthe damage reports are still rolling in from the nine tails' attack on orison and the folks at crusader are saying they might have to repair a significant proportion of the propulsors on those platforms. that's why this one's a massive order.\n\nlarger quantity, but same as before otherwise. either manufacturer them yourself using an item fabricator or source them some other way.\n\nwhen you're done, drop the propulsors off at [destination]. be a big payout with this one.\n\nta very much,\nhal grimsby\ncontracts manager\n\ncornerstone maintenance\n\"building on the foundations of our past.\" orison relief: large materials order orison relief: large supply haul orison relief: medical aid delivery orison relief: medium fabrication order orison relief: medium materials order orison relief: medium supply haul orison relief: neutralize nine tails reprisal orison relief: small fabrication order orison relief: small materials order orison relief: small supply haul orison relief: stop nine tails regrouping orison relief: strike nine tails squad 9a92d449-f8d1-4766-bae1-462e1a2cab71 853749d1-56b2-4b68-b15c-4b8516845c85 9045efe0-106a-457c-a5ef-2254469f20fb 31157e36-ae3a-45ac-aae3-6b94151f9f4c a8da4735-d681-4fa4-945c-cd44596f959a 15dd78fb-a37b-442c-93e5-63a6b52de404 071fd78d-ae7f-452d-b39a-98bfb9804c8c 183522a1-7169-4006-b50b-d17175d786f7 0dcf38f8-ddca-4c63-9e5a-990b95cedde2 2f5ef34b-20ab-4930-8420-da3f48c45cd0 8cce35ab-9b60-416d-a27e-173053b4633a 6a2d9af5-faf0-41f0-90e7-4be0e2d05c69 4f1261a1-0668-4462-975d-df4d23840e04 blueprint: carryable 2h fl mission item prototype ship component 2 a: 00eabb01-d628-49f5-a1f6-7c9df4ad9259 credits formula unresolved"
